sequenceDiagram
    participant API as Maintenance API
    participant DB as SQLite source state
    participant Build as Staging generation
    participant Validate as Validator
    participant Manifest as Active manifest

    API->>DB: Record source boundary
    API->>Build: Read source documents at boundary
    Build->>Build: Tokenize and build new postings
    Build->>DB: Replay changes after boundary
    Build->>Validate: Validate files and statistics
    Validate-->>Build: Valid generation
    Build->>Manifest: Atomic active manifest replacement
    Manifest-->>API: New generation published
